+### IDEA-009: Structural Entropy Latent Transition Abstraction
+- **Origin**: Human follow-up via `structural-entropy-proposal` skill
+- **Granularity**: ALGO
+- **Risk**: MEDIUM
+- **Admissibility**: CLEARED
